{"id":"en_black-tide-rising-vengeance-without-a-victor","title":"Black Tide Rising,Vengeance Without a Victor","titleEn":"Black Tide Rising,Vengeance Without a Victor","description":"Ethan, a Silicon Valley prodigy, built an AI empire alongside his closest friend Marcus. Their partnership shattered at the company's tenth-anniversary celebration, when Marcus publicly cast Ethan out. Ethan vanished for six years, then resurfaced armed with breakthrough technology and a hunger for payback. What he discovered instead upended everything: Marcus had been diagnosed with ALS and had deliberately accepted the role of betrayer, keeping the truth hidden so that ruthless investors would not target Ethan. Once the deception came to light, the two men parted ways. One set off to rediscover who he was; the other carried the vision they had built together toward whatever came next. Dramzio is where viewers can follow this series.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/black-tide-risingvengeance-without-a-victor/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/black-tide-risingvengeance-without-a-victor/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Betrayal","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d3i60/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_black-tide-rising-vengeance-without-a-victor_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d3i60/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_black-tide-rising-vengeance-without-a-victor_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d3i60/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_black-tide-rising-vengeance-without-a-victor_3","title":"Episode 3","se